WEBVTT

01:38.050 --> 01:43.050
[Shadow Punisher]

01:43.100 --> 01:43.570
[Divine Constable Tally]

01:43.570 --> 01:45.930
[Episode 9]

01:51.070 --> 01:51.870
What...

01:53.200 --> 01:54.229
How could this have happened?

01:54.229 --> 01:55.430
He was tortured

01:55.840 --> 01:57.430
and had no way of escaping on his own.

01:57.430 --> 01:59.009
Someone must have been behind this.

01:59.009 --> 02:00.230
It's no easy feat for an outsider

02:00.230 --> 02:01.280
to get into the Divine Constable Bureau,

02:01.280 --> 02:03.120
let alone get someone out.

02:03.950 --> 02:04.760
Could there be

02:05.870 --> 02:08.270
a mole within the Divine Constable Bureau?

02:09.840 --> 02:11.120
Investigate all personnel

02:11.120 --> 02:12.280
in the bureau who were involved

02:12.280 --> 02:13.470
in detaining Lou Tianming!

02:13.470 --> 02:14.130
Yes, Chief.

02:15.240 --> 02:15.960
Who was the last person

02:15.960 --> 02:17.120
to come into contact

02:17.120 --> 02:18.180
with Lou Tianming?

02:18.630 --> 02:19.520
Chief,

02:19.800 --> 02:21.370
it was Eunuch Zhao
from the Eastern Palace.

02:21.370 --> 02:22.470
But I don't think it makes sense

02:22.470 --> 02:23.520
to say that Eunuch Zhao

02:23.520 --> 02:24.750
did this.

02:24.840 --> 02:25.910
You specifically ordered us

02:25.910 --> 02:27.120
to avoid any mistakes when someone

02:27.120 --> 02:28.700
from the Eastern Palace
came for investigation.

02:28.700 --> 02:29.560
So Ding Mao and I were

02:29.560 --> 02:31.690
watching from the side the whole time.

02:31.740 --> 02:33.800
It's just that Eunuch Zhao was
too close to him

02:33.800 --> 02:35.120
and almost got his ear bitten off,

02:35.120 --> 02:36.430
and I stopped it. Other than that,

02:36.430 --> 02:37.760
nothing else happened.

02:39.690 --> 02:43.120
[Crown Prince's residence]

02:40.400 --> 02:41.240
You silly servant!

02:41.240 --> 02:42.360
Please spare me!

02:44.310 --> 02:45.400
Your Highness, I'm begging you!

02:45.400 --> 02:46.470
Could you please stop hitting me?

02:46.470 --> 02:48.370
The Court of Judicial Review
didn't interfere!

02:48.370 --> 02:50.030
Please spare me! I beg you!

02:50.030 --> 02:51.910
The Ministry of Justice
didn't dare to interfere!

02:51.910 --> 02:53.910
The Divine Constable Bureau was
also just watching!

02:53.910 --> 02:54.590
You...

02:54.710 --> 02:55.710
Only you!

02:56.710 --> 02:58.280
You thick-headed moron!

02:58.870 --> 03:01.030
You rushed to interrogate Lou Tianming,

03:01.030 --> 03:02.750
and now he's escaped!

03:04.840 --> 03:06.150
Your Highness!

03:06.470 --> 03:08.110
Lou Tianming's escape

03:08.130 --> 03:10.430
has absolutely nothing to do with me!

03:10.430 --> 03:11.190
Obviously!

03:12.000 --> 03:13.860
Do you even have the brains for it?

03:15.150 --> 03:15.960
Now,

03:16.870 --> 03:18.870
only you approached Lou Tianming.

03:19.030 --> 03:21.310
Even if His Majesty doesn't blame me,

03:22.079 --> 03:25.120
in his heart, that bastard, Zhou Miao,

03:25.840 --> 03:27.310
has one-upped me

03:27.310 --> 03:28.710
once again!

03:33.079 --> 03:34.000
Wait, Your Highness!

03:34.000 --> 03:34.870
You can't get anything done.

03:34.870 --> 03:36.030
You're going to beat me to death!

03:36.030 --> 03:37.310
Yet you're great at ruining things!

03:37.310 --> 03:38.000
Please stop, Your Highness.

03:38.000 --> 03:39.470
You silly servant!

03:47.120 --> 03:47.980
Your Highness.

03:48.710 --> 03:51.770
Even if you want to punish your servant,
Your Highness,

03:53.900 --> 03:56.690
[Chu Huan'er, Crown Princess]

03:54.190 --> 03:56.840
you should still leave him some dignity.

03:58.630 --> 04:00.830
You shouldn't humiliate him in public.

04:06.710 --> 04:08.110
You are my wife,

04:08.800 --> 04:10.630
the Crown Princess!

04:12.580 --> 04:13.630
You took the whip

04:13.630 --> 04:15.630
just to plead for a servant?

04:20.630 --> 04:22.430
You truly are the widely praised

04:22.480 --> 04:24.690
virtuous Crown Princess in Tianhuang City.

04:24.690 --> 04:26.150
Virtuous Crown Princess!

04:29.130 --> 04:30.400
Everyone says

04:30.630 --> 04:31.630
that I, the Crown Prince, have never

04:31.630 --> 04:32.830
done anything good.

04:34.070 --> 04:36.360
But the only thing I did right

04:36.360 --> 04:37.510
was

04:38.550 --> 04:40.370
marrying you.

04:41.200 --> 04:42.060
Your Highness,

04:42.620 --> 04:44.080
they praise me too highly.

04:44.560 --> 04:45.390
Your Highness!

04:45.390 --> 04:47.510
It's all my fault!

04:47.510 --> 04:49.240
It's only right that you beat me!

04:49.240 --> 04:51.070
Look at me! I have thick skin!

04:51.070 --> 04:52.180
You can hit me freely!

04:52.180 --> 04:54.360
But the Crown Princess is precious
and of noble birth!

04:54.360 --> 04:56.070
If she gets hurt because of me,

04:56.480 --> 04:57.560
even my death

04:57.560 --> 05:00.480
-can't make up for it, Your Highness!
-Your Highness,

05:00.480 --> 05:02.390
considering all the years

05:02.430 --> 05:03.720
Eunuch Zhao has taken good care

05:03.720 --> 05:05.190
of our child, Ye'er,

05:05.600 --> 05:07.950
please spare him this time.

05:19.830 --> 05:21.230
Sing from the beginning!

05:23.270 --> 05:26.560
Is there really a mole
in the Divine Constable Bureau?

05:30.030 --> 05:31.950
[Entry Records
of Divine Constable Bureau's Prison]

05:38.770 --> 05:40.050
[Entry Records
of Divine Constable Bureau's Prison]

05:40.180 --> 05:41.020
[Criminal, Wang, Mrs. Zhao]
[Crime: Cursed the officer with voodoo]

05:41.020 --> 05:41.870
[Punishment:
Confinement in the women's prison]

05:52.040 --> 05:53.370
His Majesty has ordered

05:53.830 --> 05:56.040
the Divine Constable Bureau
to only imprison him,

05:56.040 --> 05:57.440
but not interrogate him.

05:57.920 --> 05:59.000
Who on earth

05:59.000 --> 06:00.830
can enter and exit the dungeon freely

06:00.830 --> 06:02.490
without arousing suspicion?

06:05.680 --> 06:06.540
Your Highness,

06:07.390 --> 06:11.190
Ye'er's condition hasn't taken a turn
for the better for a long time.

06:11.190 --> 06:12.000
I'd like

06:12.310 --> 06:14.630
to use my savings from over the years

06:15.000 --> 06:17.460
to rebuild the Buddhist hall
in our mansion.

06:18.270 --> 06:19.940
I want to be more frugal myself,

06:19.940 --> 06:22.370
so I can accumulate more merit for Ye'er.

06:23.640 --> 06:26.410
Ye'er has been ill for a long time.

06:27.240 --> 06:28.250
I think it must be...

06:28.250 --> 06:29.660
Do you mean that

06:31.190 --> 06:33.520
I, the Crown Prince, am immoral

06:33.550 --> 06:35.300
and devoid of dignity and conscience,

06:35.300 --> 06:37.560
diminishing Ye'er's merit?

06:38.240 --> 06:39.090
Listen,

06:39.110 --> 06:40.460
Ye'er's poor health

06:41.110 --> 06:42.430
is all your fault!

06:42.510 --> 06:44.720
I, the Crown Prince,
have a broad face and a fine jaw

06:44.720 --> 06:46.240
and am full of vigor!

06:46.510 --> 06:48.570
That little brat you gave birth to

06:48.590 --> 06:51.070
is scrawny and sickly!

06:51.070 --> 06:52.390
How is he like me at all?

06:52.390 --> 06:53.250
Your Highness!

06:53.920 --> 06:56.240
Ye'er is smart, wise,

06:56.390 --> 06:57.680
generous, kind, and virtuous.

06:57.680 --> 06:59.560
How is he not like you?

06:59.590 --> 07:00.920
Cut the crap!

07:00.950 --> 07:01.600
Were it not for

07:01.600 --> 07:02.680
your useless womb,

07:02.680 --> 07:04.240
only giving birth to one child
in all these years,

07:04.240 --> 07:05.040
would His Majesty let

07:05.040 --> 07:07.070
Zhou Miao take charge
of the Ministry of Justice?

07:07.070 --> 07:08.480
He is coveting my position

07:08.480 --> 07:09.480
as Crown Prince.

07:09.830 --> 07:11.240
This is all your fault.

07:11.680 --> 07:13.200
You are a disaster,

07:13.310 --> 07:14.830
the root of the problem.

07:15.070 --> 07:16.680
You were born a commoner!

07:16.800 --> 07:18.720
Being able to marry me

07:18.720 --> 07:19.600
is a favor

07:19.680 --> 07:21.310
I bestowed upon you,

07:21.390 --> 07:24.250
thanks to the merit
accumulated by your ancestors!

07:32.830 --> 07:34.710
Go kneel in the Buddhist hall.

07:35.270 --> 07:37.480
Kneel for 6 hours first.

07:40.350 --> 07:41.680
Go now!

07:52.680 --> 07:53.800
I suggest

07:54.480 --> 07:56.480
that the truth of the black chest case

07:56.480 --> 07:57.630
be made public.

07:58.120 --> 07:59.000
The truth?

07:59.480 --> 08:02.120
Can the truth make Northern Kun
withdraw their troops?

08:02.120 --> 08:03.240
Can your truth

08:03.240 --> 08:04.920
bring an extra 100,000 soldiers

08:04.920 --> 08:06.600
or 100,000 provisions?

08:10.270 --> 08:12.870
The truth restores justice
in people's hearts

08:12.870 --> 08:14.680
and distinguishes right from wrong.

08:14.680 --> 08:16.480
With justice on our side,
we will be confident.

08:16.480 --> 08:19.240
With confidence, the army
and their commander will stay unbreakable.

08:19.240 --> 08:20.870
Northern Kun used Wen Bu's death

08:20.870 --> 08:22.390
as an excuse for their southward invasion,

08:22.390 --> 08:24.040
with their army approaching Great Shi.

08:24.040 --> 08:25.830
If we can prove

08:25.830 --> 08:27.240
that Wen Bu faked his death...

08:27.240 --> 08:29.100
He has already turned into water.

08:29.800 --> 08:31.360
How can we prove it?

08:32.720 --> 08:33.630
What if we

08:34.390 --> 08:35.669
bring the real Wen Bu

08:35.669 --> 08:37.669
to the army?

08:41.909 --> 08:44.080
Wen Bu is in Great Shi?

08:44.860 --> 08:45.840
To fake

08:45.840 --> 08:47.510
his death,

08:47.600 --> 08:49.870
Wen Bu absolutely couldn't stay
in Northern Kun,

08:49.870 --> 08:50.670
and he wouldn't have

08:50.670 --> 08:52.140
too many people protecting him
by his side.

08:52.140 --> 08:53.930
As long as we find Wen Bu,

08:54.480 --> 08:56.280
we can just break this deadlock.

09:01.440 --> 09:03.200
Divine Constable Bureau,
deploy all members!

09:03.200 --> 09:04.910
You must catch Wen Bu

09:04.910 --> 09:06.080
and Lou Tianming!

09:06.390 --> 09:07.200
-Understood!
-Understood!

09:06.750 --> 09:07.310
[Chief Constable's Hall]

09:07.670 --> 09:08.670
The amount of the bounty

09:08.670 --> 09:09.720
has been counted

09:09.720 --> 09:11.080
according to the usual practice.

09:11.080 --> 09:11.840
Anyone who provides

09:11.840 --> 09:13.080
the whereabouts of Wen Bu and Lou Tianming

09:13.080 --> 09:14.160
will be rewarded with 50 taels of silver.

09:14.160 --> 09:15.480
500 taels of silver
for capturing the two wanted men.

09:15.480 --> 09:17.240
Please sign and seal, My Lord, My Lady.

09:15.740 --> 09:16.030
[Special Notice
from the Divine Constable Bureau]

09:17.210 --> 09:18.070
[Wanted]

09:18.130 --> 09:19.620
[Tianhuang City]

09:18.510 --> 09:19.480
On land,

09:19.480 --> 09:21.270
the Divine Constable Bureau
will use post horses

09:19.730 --> 09:21.140
[Wen Bu] [Lou Tiantian]

09:21.270 --> 09:22.870
to block every key post house in advance
and cut off

09:22.870 --> 09:24.270
-their access to horses and supplies.
-Take a look.

09:24.270 --> 09:25.510
Have you seen this person?

09:25.510 --> 09:26.400
No.

09:26.370 --> 09:29.920
[Proclamation]

09:26.480 --> 09:27.480
By water,

09:27.480 --> 09:29.030
we will use
the water vein tracking technique,

09:29.030 --> 09:29.790
relying on the current

09:29.790 --> 09:31.910
to spread news to downstream
fishing villages and ferries.

09:31.910 --> 09:33.240
Fishermen who find the pills
and report to the authorities

09:33.240 --> 09:35.040
will get their rewards of money.

09:44.600 --> 09:45.390
Chief.

09:46.240 --> 09:47.150
No clues.

09:47.600 --> 09:48.750
It's been 3 days,

09:49.030 --> 09:50.480
and there is still no trace?

09:50.480 --> 09:51.340
Could it be that

09:51.840 --> 09:54.440
they have already
left the Great Shi territory?

09:54.440 --> 09:55.440
Be patient.

09:56.030 --> 09:58.030
Maybe there will be a turning point.

09:58.270 --> 09:59.720
After all, our Divine Constable Bureau

09:59.720 --> 10:01.120
is full of hidden talents,

10:01.120 --> 10:03.050
each with their own unique skills.

10:10.320 --> 10:11.120
Young Master,

10:11.600 --> 10:12.870
I can't do anything about

10:12.870 --> 10:13.840
Constable Meng's injury.

10:13.840 --> 10:14.270
Please

10:14.270 --> 10:15.870
don't call me over again.

10:16.480 --> 10:17.240
I know.

10:17.630 --> 10:19.760
I'm not here to ask you to save Meng Rui.

10:25.700 --> 10:27.190
Let me see.

10:27.440 --> 10:28.900
If you can't save Meng Rui,

10:30.270 --> 10:31.550
can you save this?

11:53.200 --> 11:55.000
Lou Tianming, Lou Tianming.

11:55.020 --> 11:56.270
You kept saying that

11:56.270 --> 11:58.240
your black chest plan was flawless

11:58.360 --> 12:00.160
and would definitely kill Bai Qi

12:00.240 --> 12:03.480
to eliminate a great threat
to Northern Kun's southern expedition.

12:03.480 --> 12:04.390
And the result?

12:05.200 --> 12:06.550
I also heard

12:06.570 --> 12:09.500
that you were caught
by the Divine Constable Bureau.

12:11.200 --> 12:12.000
It seems that

12:12.870 --> 12:14.200
the Kingdom of Liluo and the demons

12:14.200 --> 12:15.080
you mentioned

12:15.080 --> 12:16.230
aren't that great.

12:20.750 --> 12:22.080
I've been traveling all the way

12:22.080 --> 12:22.840
and finally

12:22.840 --> 12:24.670
escaped the encirclement
of the Divine Constable Bureau.

12:24.670 --> 12:26.080
I'm really starving.

12:26.750 --> 12:28.600
I wonder if you, Prince Wenbu,

12:28.790 --> 12:31.000
could give me some food.

12:54.360 --> 12:56.080
What a fine piece of meat.

12:57.000 --> 12:59.000
It's a pity I'm not a beast.

12:59.620 --> 13:01.820
How could I eat raw meat and drink blood?

13:02.840 --> 13:03.910
But you,

13:04.440 --> 13:06.370
who sacrificed your subordinates

13:07.000 --> 13:09.000
and disregarded the common people,

13:09.960 --> 13:13.000
truly deserve the word "beast."

13:13.240 --> 13:14.200
What did you say?

13:28.390 --> 13:30.600
We once met
at the Star-Gathering Pavilion.

13:30.600 --> 13:32.750
You are Young Master Qingyang, Li Si.

13:33.150 --> 13:35.290
A powerful master like Yan Zige

13:35.670 --> 13:37.720
served you and died for you.

13:38.350 --> 13:40.310
Calling you a beast just now

13:40.420 --> 13:41.940
is an insult to beasts.

13:42.560 --> 13:44.560
Beasts don't harm their own kind.

13:44.840 --> 13:45.720
But you do.

13:47.750 --> 13:50.320
How dare Lou Tianming betray me!

13:50.790 --> 13:51.600
You're wrong.

13:52.750 --> 13:55.550
Lou Tianming didn't say anything.

13:56.000 --> 13:57.360
It was just my guess.

13:57.630 --> 14:00.080
For Lou Tianming to establish contact

14:00.080 --> 14:01.480
with you, Your Highness,

14:01.790 --> 14:02.670
he must have used

14:02.670 --> 14:04.270
something to send messages.

14:04.790 --> 14:06.240
The carrier pigeons
of the Divine Constable Bureau

14:06.240 --> 14:08.000
are all recorded when they come and go.

14:08.000 --> 14:10.060
Lou Tianming wouldn't dare use them.

14:10.730 --> 14:12.190
So I guessed...

14:15.000 --> 14:16.000
What he used

14:16.390 --> 14:18.200
must be his falcon.

14:20.870 --> 14:22.600
The night the demons attacked,

14:22.720 --> 14:24.720
it happened to fall right at my feet.

14:25.550 --> 14:28.150
I asked a doctor to heal it.

14:28.790 --> 14:31.240
I trained it a bit

14:31.630 --> 14:32.670
and followed it.

14:33.390 --> 14:34.320
It naturally

14:34.320 --> 14:35.390
led me here.

14:43.340 --> 14:44.740
Your Highness,

14:46.510 --> 14:47.860
don't worry.

14:48.630 --> 14:50.910
I am just a trainee constable

14:50.910 --> 14:52.640
of the Divine Constable Bureau

14:52.790 --> 14:54.790
with no authority to deploy people.

14:55.240 --> 14:56.390
I came here

14:57.030 --> 14:58.550
alone.

15:08.150 --> 15:09.390
In this case,

15:09.440 --> 15:11.720
what can you do to me by yourself?

15:37.630 --> 15:39.960
The 6 ancient gods of Liluo—

15:40.670 --> 15:44.480
Immortality, Prophecy, Lies,

15:41.410 --> 15:44.250
[God of Prophecy, Rangnan]

15:45.000 --> 15:49.390
Hatred, Disaster, and Death.

15:51.630 --> 15:54.290
Now that the mystery
of the black chest is solved

15:54.760 --> 15:57.820
and the God of Prophecy
has finally fallen,

15:58.840 --> 16:02.240
cheer, rejoice,

16:02.550 --> 16:04.820
and turn a blind eye.

16:06.440 --> 16:09.630
This is my gift to Great Shi.

16:10.490 --> 16:13.330
I hope you like it.

16:14.700 --> 16:16.050
Your Majesty,

16:16.150 --> 16:18.120
Wenbu has confessed everything.

16:18.440 --> 16:19.440
Behind Lou Tianming,

16:19.440 --> 16:21.030
there is a mysterious organization

16:21.030 --> 16:22.290
called the Dark Night.

16:22.480 --> 16:23.960
Its members are all

16:23.960 --> 16:26.210
formidable killers
who are neither human nor ghost.

16:26.210 --> 16:27.320
The Dark Night?

16:29.000 --> 16:31.060
What does the Dark Night stand to gain

16:31.360 --> 16:33.160
by conspiring with Northern Kun

16:34.480 --> 16:37.200
against our Great Shi?

16:37.550 --> 16:39.150
All members of the Dark Night

16:40.000 --> 16:41.670
swear allegiance to Liluo.

16:44.440 --> 16:46.500
In the third year of Zhengwu's reign,

16:47.380 --> 16:50.060
the late Emperor Wuzong of Shi
wiped out Liluo.

16:51.630 --> 16:52.630
Who would have thought

16:52.630 --> 16:54.240
that decades later,

16:55.360 --> 16:57.140
these remnants of Liluo

16:57.240 --> 16:59.790
would still be plotting a rebellion?

17:02.030 --> 17:04.720
That's all Wenbu knows.

17:05.069 --> 17:06.829
I've sent him to the Envoy Residence

17:06.829 --> 17:08.000
and placed him under strict guard.

17:08.000 --> 17:09.640
He awaits Your Majesty's judgment.

17:09.640 --> 17:11.550
I ordered you to capture Meng Rui

17:11.550 --> 17:13.109
and give me an explanation.

17:13.349 --> 17:14.160
Yet you

17:15.240 --> 17:16.230
brought me news

17:16.230 --> 17:17.960
of the people of Liluo instead.

17:20.270 --> 17:21.790
You did well.

17:23.240 --> 17:24.270
But, Shan,

17:25.589 --> 17:26.750
this is the first time

17:26.750 --> 17:28.480
you've gone against my wishes.

17:30.200 --> 17:32.510
Meng Rui is neither kin nor friend to you.

17:32.680 --> 17:34.880
Why are you protecting him so fiercely?

17:34.960 --> 17:36.480
What I protect

17:37.070 --> 17:38.350
is not Meng Rui,

17:38.880 --> 17:40.680
but justice and righteousness,

17:41.270 --> 17:43.070
the truth and public sentiment.

17:50.000 --> 17:52.110
Years ago, I told your sister

17:52.790 --> 17:54.920
that I could find you a good match.

17:55.640 --> 17:57.240
Among all the court officials,

17:57.240 --> 17:59.000
royal relatives and nobles,

17:59.440 --> 18:00.840
you could take your pick.

18:02.160 --> 18:04.760
Why bring this up
all of a sudden, Your Majesty?

18:06.270 --> 18:07.880
You refused at the time.

18:09.000 --> 18:09.790
You said,

18:10.270 --> 18:12.830
since your sister had already
married into the royal family,

18:12.830 --> 18:13.640
then

18:14.000 --> 18:16.530
you wished only to
serve the court faithfully

18:16.590 --> 18:19.590
and insisted on joining
the Divine Constable Bureau.

18:20.240 --> 18:21.920
I hesitated then.

18:23.030 --> 18:23.960
Do you know

18:24.960 --> 18:26.510
why I hesitated?

18:28.000 --> 18:31.010
The Divine Constable Bureau
stands outside the Six Ministries.

18:31.010 --> 18:33.010
It is Your Majesty's eyes and hands.

18:33.440 --> 18:35.830
But my elder sister was already Empress,

18:35.830 --> 18:37.230
ruling the inner palace.

18:37.240 --> 18:40.200
If I became Chief Commissioner as well,

18:41.750 --> 18:43.680
then the Xuanyuan family might...

18:45.440 --> 18:48.680
might be suspected of
abusing its power as imperial in-laws.

18:48.680 --> 18:50.750
So I made you swear an oath.

18:51.270 --> 18:53.550
If you joined the Divine Constable Bureau,

18:53.550 --> 18:55.590
you could never marry in your lifetime,

18:55.590 --> 18:56.750
nor have children.

18:57.880 --> 18:59.400
Because the position of Chief Commissioner

18:59.400 --> 19:00.350
of the Divine Constable Bureau

19:00.350 --> 19:02.080
allows no personal interests.

19:03.000 --> 19:05.270
The only family
you could have in this lifetime

19:05.270 --> 19:06.550
would be me.

19:11.590 --> 19:13.750
I understand, Your Majesty.

19:15.160 --> 19:17.030
Investigate Liluo and Lou Tianming

19:17.030 --> 19:17.960
together.

19:19.550 --> 19:21.960
The Divine Constable Bureau
is heavily guarded.

19:21.960 --> 19:23.400
Without an insider,

19:24.500 --> 19:26.190
how could they have escaped?

19:28.350 --> 19:29.160
Yes, Your Majesty.

19:29.060 --> 19:31.790
[Star-Gathering Pavilion]

19:40.600 --> 19:42.200
This is truly divine nectar.

19:52.070 --> 19:53.050
You forcibly activated

19:53.050 --> 19:54.640
the Soaring Dragon
Thousand-Mechanism Formation,

19:54.640 --> 19:56.590
and you're suffering
internal injuries too.

19:56.590 --> 19:58.240
Yet you still want to drink?

19:58.790 --> 19:59.990
Are you trying to die?

20:05.550 --> 20:07.000
These past few days, Tianhuang City

20:07.000 --> 20:08.480
has been searching
for Meng Rui everywhere.

20:08.480 --> 20:09.440
Looks like the Emperor,

20:09.440 --> 20:10.790
regardless of the truth,

20:10.790 --> 20:12.390
is determined to use Meng Rui

20:12.680 --> 20:14.740
to give Northern Kun an explanation.

20:16.030 --> 20:17.240
This scene

20:17.790 --> 20:19.590
is just like 17 years ago.

20:27.640 --> 20:28.680
Do you happen to know

20:28.680 --> 20:30.160
where Meng Rui is?

20:32.030 --> 20:32.790
What?

20:33.480 --> 20:35.510
You won't even tell your own master?

20:39.650 --> 20:42.060
I don't want to know anyway.

20:42.240 --> 20:43.210
Seriously.

20:46.550 --> 20:48.400
Using the investigation as an excuse,

20:48.400 --> 20:49.270
you've met

20:49.270 --> 20:50.600
Zhou Miao and Zhou Tiao.

20:51.030 --> 20:51.790
How is it?

20:52.440 --> 20:53.790
Did you find anything?

21:04.030 --> 21:05.230
Seventeen years ago,

21:05.270 --> 21:07.240
Big Brother falsely reported
a military emergency

21:07.240 --> 21:08.350
to lure Father away

21:09.350 --> 21:11.030
and then notified Second Brother.

21:11.030 --> 21:13.720
The two of them conspired together

21:14.790 --> 21:17.590
and tried to kill me
at Mulan Hunting Grounds.

21:18.790 --> 21:19.790
After I died,

21:20.200 --> 21:21.400
Father learned about

21:21.640 --> 21:23.170
the false military report.

21:25.400 --> 21:27.260
Big Brother took responsibility

21:27.300 --> 21:30.440
and voluntarily gave up
his position in the Ministry of War.

21:30.440 --> 21:31.880
He also had everyone

21:32.000 --> 21:34.100
in the Ministry of War who knew the truth

21:34.100 --> 21:35.390
silenced.

21:38.070 --> 21:39.130
If that's the case,

21:39.530 --> 21:41.060
what are you planning to do?

21:46.250 --> 21:47.450
I know Father well.

21:48.700 --> 21:49.900
Seventeen years ago,

21:50.380 --> 21:51.650
he buried the truth

21:52.350 --> 21:54.320
and chose not to pursue
Big Brother or Second Brother.

21:54.320 --> 21:55.390
That shows

21:57.680 --> 21:59.380
that in his heart,

21:59.960 --> 22:02.490
he cares only about
keeping the court stable.

22:03.290 --> 22:05.050
If you truly wanted revenge,

22:05.150 --> 22:06.380
seventeen years ago,

22:06.930 --> 22:08.730
you could have gone straight

22:08.870 --> 22:10.410
to your father,
regardless of the consequences.

22:10.410 --> 22:11.680
At least you could have

22:11.710 --> 22:13.310
forced a lose-lose outcome.

22:13.540 --> 22:14.670
But you didn't.

22:20.440 --> 22:21.240
Now,

22:21.880 --> 22:23.480
what else can I do

22:23.500 --> 22:25.630
besides secretly gathering evidence

22:26.200 --> 22:28.060
and waiting for the right moment?

22:28.750 --> 22:31.000
There's just one thing

22:32.000 --> 22:34.400
I need to investigate at Tianshu Pavilion.

22:36.960 --> 22:38.260
Mr. Meng

22:38.280 --> 22:40.000
really had a brush with death this time.

22:40.000 --> 22:40.510
Meng Rui!

22:40.510 --> 22:41.200
Who is that?

22:41.200 --> 22:41.790
Little Ice Cube.

22:41.790 --> 22:42.310
Mr. Yan.

22:42.310 --> 22:42.760
Where is he?

22:42.760 --> 22:43.960
-Mr. Yan.
-Mr. Yan.

22:44.240 --> 22:45.280
This...

22:46.500 --> 22:48.120
What happened, Zhenzhu?

22:48.190 --> 22:49.450
Li Si brought him back.

22:51.050 --> 22:52.990
Turns out he was the one who hid him.

22:53.020 --> 22:54.110
Tao, how is he?

22:54.400 --> 22:56.010
I can only say I'll do my best.

22:56.030 --> 22:56.820
What do you mean, "do your best"?

22:56.820 --> 22:58.040
You have to heal him!

22:58.400 --> 22:59.200
Yes.

22:59.770 --> 23:00.600
Where's Qingyang?

23:00.600 --> 23:03.000
He left after getting everything settled.

23:03.360 --> 23:05.020
How did he get hurt this badly?

23:11.260 --> 23:14.910
[Winter's Haven Beneath the Azure Heavens]

24:07.610 --> 24:09.010
Whether he pulls through

24:09.500 --> 24:11.630
will depend on the next couple of days.

24:18.010 --> 24:20.360
Brother, your kite is so high!

24:20.380 --> 24:21.880
Higher, please!

24:21.880 --> 24:22.550
Okay.

24:23.110 --> 24:24.550
Higher, please!

24:25.350 --> 24:26.880
Brother, higher!

24:26.900 --> 24:28.100
Higher!

24:28.160 --> 24:30.150
-A little higher!
-Okay.

24:31.070 --> 24:32.110
Higher!

24:32.790 --> 24:33.590
Mother!

24:33.590 --> 24:34.030
Come on.

24:34.030 --> 24:35.260
Look.

24:35.440 --> 24:36.580
It's so high!

24:36.780 --> 24:37.980
Father!

24:42.450 --> 24:43.250
Come quickly!

24:44.200 --> 24:45.000
I'm coming.

24:45.200 --> 24:46.130
It's beautiful.

25:06.480 --> 25:07.270
We're back.

25:08.590 --> 25:10.400
Look, all these tonics.

25:10.600 --> 25:11.400
Qingyang,

25:11.560 --> 25:12.690
thank you for paying

25:12.720 --> 25:13.750
for Meng Rui's medicine.

25:13.750 --> 25:14.550
I appreciate your help, Yan.

25:14.550 --> 25:15.370
It's no trouble.

25:15.370 --> 25:16.030
Put them down.

25:16.030 --> 25:16.600
Okay.

25:16.620 --> 25:17.290
Tao,

25:17.840 --> 25:19.110
we have Lingzhi mushrooms
from Haisong Mountain

25:19.110 --> 25:20.970
that are over a hundred years old,

25:21.080 --> 25:22.810
as well as snow-grown Cordyceps,

25:22.810 --> 25:23.990
Chonghua snow lotus,

25:23.990 --> 25:26.670
Polygonatum, dragon's blood,
and white-banded snake.

25:26.670 --> 25:27.470
Take a look

25:27.830 --> 25:28.510
and see if there's anything

25:28.510 --> 25:29.720
that might be useful.

25:39.920 --> 25:41.070
Why aren't you saying anything?

25:41.070 --> 25:42.600
What's wrong with Meng Rui?

25:43.110 --> 25:45.110
His condition is stable for now,

25:46.110 --> 25:47.550
but strangely,

25:49.030 --> 25:50.000
he seems to be

25:50.000 --> 25:51.730
in a deep sleep, lost in a dream.

25:52.110 --> 25:53.040
And what's more,

25:53.400 --> 25:55.200
he doesn't even want to wake up.

25:59.890 --> 26:00.680
Ms. Bai,

26:01.030 --> 26:02.160
you're a physician.

26:02.510 --> 26:04.440
You should understand what I mean.

26:06.170 --> 26:07.610
Whether he wakes up

26:08.050 --> 26:09.820
depends on whether he wants to.

26:09.850 --> 26:11.110
Wait. What do you mean?

26:12.720 --> 26:13.840
I've heard of cases

26:14.360 --> 26:15.470
like this.

26:16.090 --> 26:17.050
When someone

26:17.570 --> 26:19.830
has been through a great deal of tragedy,

26:20.200 --> 26:23.000
if they're strong-minded
in their everyday life,

26:23.280 --> 26:25.210
they may become unafraid of death.

26:25.580 --> 26:28.440
But once someone like that
suffers a serious injury

26:28.460 --> 26:30.390
and can no longer remain rational,

26:30.960 --> 26:32.610
the will to live within them

26:32.820 --> 26:34.020
can easily fade away.

26:34.780 --> 26:35.950
Simply put,

26:36.420 --> 26:38.620
he doesn't even want to live anymore.

26:41.350 --> 26:42.160
I wonder what Mr. Meng

26:42.160 --> 26:43.490
must have been through.

26:43.570 --> 26:44.640
Wait. You mean

26:44.640 --> 26:46.440
he doesn't want to live anymore?

26:46.510 --> 26:47.510
But why?

26:55.960 --> 26:56.960
In this world,

26:57.530 --> 26:59.190
there are indeed many things,

26:59.500 --> 27:00.560
many experiences,

27:01.360 --> 27:03.820
that can make someone
no longer want to live,

27:04.000 --> 27:06.260
that can make life feel worse than death.

27:30.160 --> 27:31.220
Mr. Meng,

27:32.200 --> 27:33.350
you have to hold on.

27:35.890 --> 27:36.840
I believe

27:37.330 --> 27:39.150
you wouldn't want this sword

27:39.910 --> 27:41.840
to fall silent forever, would you?

27:59.140 --> 28:03.790
[Severe-Cold]

28:11.510 --> 28:13.940
Brother, your kite is so high!

28:13.970 --> 28:15.340
Higher!

28:15.910 --> 28:17.390
Higher!

28:27.760 --> 28:28.760
Brother!

28:46.510 --> 28:48.270
Don't touch my sword.

28:48.770 --> 28:49.570
Meng Rui.

28:49.770 --> 28:50.450
He's awake.

28:50.470 --> 28:51.230
Meng!

28:51.260 --> 28:52.440
Meng is awake!

28:53.940 --> 28:55.210
-Meng.
-Meng is awake!

28:55.270 --> 28:56.350
-Meng.
-Meng is awake!

28:56.350 --> 28:57.500
Meng is awake.

28:57.550 --> 28:58.350
Meng!

28:58.920 --> 28:59.550
Meng Rui!

29:00.620 --> 29:02.570
[Severe-Cold]

29:04.030 --> 29:05.210
Meng is awake!

29:05.310 --> 29:06.270
Meng is awake!

29:06.270 --> 29:07.750
- Meng is awake!
- Really? That's great!

29:07.750 --> 29:08.720
Lord Constable Ghost is awake!

29:08.720 --> 29:09.880
Jiang Zhan, hurry!

29:10.680 --> 29:11.750
Meng is awake!

29:11.790 --> 29:13.440
Mr. Meng is awake? That's wonderful!

29:11.820 --> 29:13.330
[Chief Constable's Hall]

29:13.440 --> 29:14.310
Chief!

29:14.920 --> 29:16.100
Chief!

29:17.290 --> 29:18.260
Reporting, Chief.

29:18.260 --> 29:19.400
Meng is awake!

29:32.850 --> 29:34.270
- Meng!
- Meng!

29:34.640 --> 29:35.240
Meng!

29:35.240 --> 29:35.960
- You're not fully recovered yet.
- Meng!

29:35.960 --> 29:36.680
- You can't go!
- Meng!

29:36.680 --> 29:37.680
I have to go.

29:37.680 --> 29:38.680
Stay right there!

29:39.840 --> 29:41.570
You were only well for two days.

29:41.880 --> 29:43.310
What are you up to now?

29:44.830 --> 29:46.090
I need to see the Chief.

29:46.410 --> 29:47.870
Why can't you just behave?

29:55.330 --> 29:57.240
The Chief went to see His Majesty

29:57.350 --> 29:58.640
and hasn't returned yet.

29:58.640 --> 29:59.880
If I were you,

30:00.350 --> 30:02.160
I'd stay put

30:02.160 --> 30:03.560
and get some proper rest.

30:03.590 --> 30:04.400
After all,

30:04.910 --> 30:07.800
there's no need to rush.

30:08.680 --> 30:10.700
The Liluo Night Demons are running wild.

30:10.700 --> 30:12.110
How can I rest easy?

30:12.110 --> 30:13.400
You just crawled back

30:13.400 --> 30:13.960
from hell,

30:13.960 --> 30:15.030
so don't push your luck.

30:15.030 --> 30:15.830
What?

30:16.260 --> 30:17.350
You think the Divine Constable Bureau

30:17.350 --> 30:18.880
can't get by without you?

30:20.240 --> 30:21.030
Yan,

30:21.050 --> 30:22.070
that's just how Meng Rui is.

30:22.070 --> 30:23.600
You should know that by now.

30:26.090 --> 30:27.260
Where are you going?

30:27.630 --> 30:28.740
Physician Tao said

30:28.760 --> 30:30.450
Mr. Meng mustn't move around yet.

30:30.450 --> 30:31.880
Carry him to the sedan chair!

30:31.880 --> 30:32.590
Do you hear that?

30:32.590 --> 30:32.830
Understood.

30:32.830 --> 30:34.070
Get him out of here!

30:34.070 --> 30:34.510
Hurry!

30:34.510 --> 30:35.110
Please, Meng.

30:35.110 --> 30:35.770
Let go of me!

30:35.770 --> 30:36.690
Sit still!

30:36.850 --> 30:38.890
Just sit back and relax.

30:38.910 --> 30:39.670
Lord Yan,

30:39.750 --> 30:40.940
look after Lord Meng.

30:40.940 --> 30:42.380
Leave him to me.

30:42.440 --> 30:43.640
Lift the sedan chair!

30:44.260 --> 30:45.960
You little rascal. Got you now!

30:45.960 --> 30:46.720
Put me down!

30:46.750 --> 30:48.210
Yan, I need to see the Chief!

30:48.210 --> 30:50.420
- You will.
- Mr. Meng, don't worry.

30:50.750 --> 30:52.310
We'll get you home

30:52.310 --> 30:53.030
safe and sound.

30:53.030 --> 30:53.830
You got it!

30:53.960 --> 30:54.750
Li Si!

31:05.680 --> 31:08.120
- Grand Secretary Bai.
- Grand Secretary Bai.

31:08.120 --> 31:10.040
[Chief Constable's Hall]

31:11.830 --> 31:12.640
Father?

31:13.790 --> 31:14.590
Zhenzhu.

31:15.550 --> 31:16.680
What brings you here?

31:16.680 --> 31:18.150
You could've told me first.

31:18.150 --> 31:20.140
I'm the Prime Minister, after all.

31:20.170 --> 31:21.510
Am I not allowed to visit?

31:21.330 --> 31:23.290
[Head Constable's Hall]

31:21.960 --> 31:22.830
Besides,

31:22.830 --> 31:23.480
I'm your father.

31:23.480 --> 31:25.240
Isn't it only natural to visit

31:25.240 --> 31:26.510
my daughter's workplace?

31:26.130 --> 31:28.610
[Head Constable's Hall]

31:26.680 --> 31:27.480
Yes.

31:28.740 --> 31:31.150
[Pillar of the Realm]

31:31.160 --> 31:32.720
Father, have some tea.

31:33.790 --> 31:35.520
Did you need something from me?

31:36.830 --> 31:37.590
Zhenzhu,

31:37.590 --> 31:38.750
I had this sachet custom-made

31:38.750 --> 31:39.640
for you.

31:39.880 --> 31:40.680
Look,

31:40.830 --> 31:42.880
aren't the pearls on it beautiful?

31:42.900 --> 31:43.690
Here.

31:43.720 --> 31:44.810
Come on, take it.

31:46.680 --> 31:47.480
Father,

31:47.820 --> 31:49.710
I don't really use these.

31:50.090 --> 31:51.830
It contains precious spices

31:51.830 --> 31:53.290
from the Western Regions.

31:53.780 --> 31:56.090
Its rich fragrance lasts all year.

31:56.120 --> 31:57.410
You're a young woman,

31:57.430 --> 31:59.130
dealing with corpses every day.

31:59.130 --> 32:00.960
You should take better care of yourself.

32:00.960 --> 32:02.200
Come on, take it.

32:02.480 --> 32:03.280
Be a good girl.

32:03.960 --> 32:04.750
Father.

32:05.480 --> 32:06.160
Your daughter

32:06.160 --> 32:07.990
isn't like those rich young ladies.

32:07.990 --> 32:09.910
Besides, this is official business.

32:09.910 --> 32:11.640
All you ever care about is work.

32:12.530 --> 32:13.480
Zhenzhu,

32:13.510 --> 32:15.220
why don't you come home with me?

32:15.220 --> 32:16.950
You're already twenty-three.

32:17.010 --> 32:18.620
It's time you got married.

32:19.160 --> 32:19.960
Father.

32:20.070 --> 32:20.680
Can't you

32:20.680 --> 32:22.340
stop making decisions for me?

32:24.830 --> 32:26.100
It's all Xuanyuan's fault

32:26.100 --> 32:27.610
for taking such a liking to you!

32:27.610 --> 32:28.960
I'd say

32:28.960 --> 32:30.580
your Bureau got quite a bargain!

32:30.580 --> 32:31.970
How can you say that?

32:31.990 --> 32:32.510
The Bureau

32:32.510 --> 32:33.480
pays me a salary, too,

32:33.480 --> 32:33.960
you know.

32:33.960 --> 32:35.480
With that meager salary of yours,

32:35.480 --> 32:37.350
you'd rather stretch every coin

32:37.350 --> 32:38.500
than take money from home.

32:38.500 --> 32:40.230
Does our money burn your hands?

32:40.270 --> 32:41.270
My money, my rules.

32:41.270 --> 32:42.330
I'm happy that way.

32:51.480 --> 32:52.270
Father.

32:52.960 --> 32:54.270
You can rest assured.

32:54.350 --> 32:56.110
I can take care of myself.

32:56.390 --> 32:57.590
Don't worry about me.

33:02.270 --> 33:03.070
All right.

33:03.830 --> 33:06.270
It's time I headed back.

33:08.070 --> 33:08.830
Father!

33:11.730 --> 33:12.780
Take this back.

33:12.810 --> 33:14.070
I really don't need it.

33:23.120 --> 33:26.490
[Star-Gathering Pavilion]

33:30.330 --> 33:31.330
Master is here.

33:46.920 --> 33:48.880
You two may leave.

33:49.060 --> 33:49.860
Yes, sir.

33:51.420 --> 33:53.350
Sorry to keep you waiting, Ms. Bai.

33:55.850 --> 33:57.880
This must be your first time

33:57.910 --> 34:00.110
dining at my Star-Gathering Pavilion.

34:00.270 --> 34:01.340
I've investigated cases here,

34:01.340 --> 34:03.130
but never dined here before.

34:07.260 --> 34:08.830
You saved my father, Lord Li.

34:08.830 --> 34:10.540
So it's only right

34:10.690 --> 34:12.290
that I treat you to this meal.

34:20.590 --> 34:21.400
Please, sit.

34:25.730 --> 34:26.600
Ms. Bai,

34:29.320 --> 34:31.710
no need for formalities.

34:31.730 --> 34:33.370
Just call me by my name.

34:33.590 --> 34:34.770
Calling me "Lord"

34:34.800 --> 34:36.110
seems a bit too formal.

34:43.560 --> 34:45.960
There's something

34:46.670 --> 34:48.270
I've been meaning to ask you.

34:49.989 --> 34:51.030
Go ahead, Ms. Bai.

34:52.050 --> 34:53.219
May I ask, Master Li,

34:53.620 --> 34:55.280
what's your true background?

35:01.430 --> 35:02.470
I suspect

35:03.370 --> 35:04.860
you're not the only one

35:05.710 --> 35:06.800
in our bureau

35:06.800 --> 35:08.060
who's been wondering.

35:18.580 --> 35:21.740
Have you ever played Go?

35:25.840 --> 35:27.110
I'm like

35:27.510 --> 35:28.800
a piece

35:28.800 --> 35:29.920
on a Go board.

35:33.860 --> 35:35.790
I once occupied the central point.

35:36.010 --> 35:37.350
The pieces on all sides

35:37.850 --> 35:39.450
seemed to pay me due respect,

35:39.780 --> 35:43.290
but were secretly plotting to kill me.

35:44.920 --> 35:46.280
How could you respond?

35:50.580 --> 35:51.870
It's a chained ko.

35:52.830 --> 35:54.830
If two opposing pieces join forces,

35:55.050 --> 35:56.580
I have no chance of winning.

36:02.280 --> 36:03.070
Besides,

36:04.080 --> 36:05.000
I'm nothing more

36:05.000 --> 36:06.330
than a mere chess piece.

36:07.240 --> 36:09.220
The player doesn't care

36:09.920 --> 36:12.130
what becomes of a single piece.

36:13.580 --> 36:14.820
So it seems

36:15.530 --> 36:16.990
you're a sacrificed pawn.

36:18.100 --> 36:19.180
That's right.

36:21.710 --> 36:27.740
[Wind and Moon]

36:25.630 --> 36:27.320
Look at your vast estate,

36:28.300 --> 36:30.430
not to mention your wisdom and skills.

36:30.760 --> 36:32.560
You claim to be a discarded pawn?

36:32.710 --> 36:33.770
I don't believe it.

36:41.310 --> 36:44.230
You're wrong, Ms. Bai.

36:45.350 --> 36:46.610
Even a discarded piece

36:47.020 --> 36:48.670
has its purpose.

36:51.910 --> 36:52.730
In the hands

36:52.760 --> 36:54.830
of someone cunning and unpredictable,

36:54.830 --> 36:57.870
even a discarded piece
can become a killing piece.

37:01.810 --> 37:03.640
The man you see before you

37:04.270 --> 37:06.500
is one who can crush all opposition.

37:08.160 --> 37:09.440
But in the end,

37:10.040 --> 37:11.260
win or lose,

37:11.290 --> 37:12.890
it's all just a game of chess.

37:13.290 --> 37:15.130
Whether you're a sacrificed piece

37:15.130 --> 37:16.820
doesn't really matter.

37:16.850 --> 37:18.880
But what if the game is big enough

37:21.070 --> 37:23.240
to encompass an entire world?

37:23.730 --> 37:25.460
And the pieces on the board

37:25.840 --> 37:27.770
are the common people themselves.

37:28.440 --> 37:29.590
Would you still say

37:29.630 --> 37:30.690
it doesn't matter?

37:39.620 --> 37:41.080
For the sake of the people,

37:42.930 --> 37:45.630
we cannot afford to lose.

37:48.000 --> 37:48.710
So what if I become

37:48.710 --> 37:50.840
a pawn controlled by others?

37:51.760 --> 37:53.760
Even if I'm torn to pieces,

37:54.560 --> 37:56.950
I'll press on without hesitation.

38:22.060 --> 38:24.690
[Tianshu Pavilion]

38:22.880 --> 38:23.630
Li Si,

38:24.230 --> 38:26.760
you captured Prince Wenbu
in the Black Chest Case

38:26.760 --> 38:28.400
and averted a crisis
on Great Shi's borders.

38:28.130 --> 38:36.660
[Tianshu Pavilion]

38:28.710 --> 38:30.570
You deserve the greatest credit.

38:30.930 --> 38:31.960
Constable Frost and Constable Iron

38:31.960 --> 38:33.620
have also praised you highly.

38:34.320 --> 38:35.510
In recognition

38:35.510 --> 38:36.830
of your outstanding achievements,

38:36.830 --> 38:38.070
you are hereby promoted

38:38.070 --> 38:39.400
to Divine Constable of the Bureau.

38:38.950 --> 38:40.930
[Qingyang Divine Constable]

38:39.630 --> 38:42.090
You are granted
the Divine Constable Tally.

38:54.510 --> 38:56.010
Thank you, Chief.

38:55.940 --> 38:56.410
[Divine Constable Tally]

38:57.420 --> 38:58.990
[Qingyang Divine Constable]

39:02.080 --> 39:05.180
[Qingyang Divine Constable]

39:11.150 --> 39:18.240
[Tianshu Pavilion]

39:53.230 --> 39:55.960
Tianshu Pavilion holds
all the world's secrets.

39:56.510 --> 39:58.510
Its archives are organized

39:58.600 --> 40:01.400
according to the hidden codes
of heaven and earth.

40:03.040 --> 40:05.010
Section Jia records royal affairs

40:05.030 --> 40:06.890
and secrets of the imperial clan.

40:08.910 --> 40:11.280
Section Yi covers
criminal cases, cold cases,

40:11.280 --> 40:12.630
and martial-world vendettas.

40:12.000 --> 40:15.020
[Heaven]

40:13.630 --> 40:15.510
Section Bing covers
astronomy and astrology,

40:15.060 --> 40:17.550
[Jiashen] [Jiawu] [Jiaxu]

40:15.760 --> 40:17.690
as well as geography and feng shui.

40:19.440 --> 40:20.440
And so on.

40:19.560 --> 40:20.610
[Bingyin] [Bingzi] [Bingxu] [Bingjia]

40:20.760 --> 40:21.500
[Water]

40:20.800 --> 40:22.480
The princes' hunt grounds,
year 20 of Hongyun,

40:22.300 --> 40:22.640
[Wind]

40:22.510 --> 40:23.810
the burning disaster.

40:23.830 --> 40:25.250
Jia represents imperial power,

40:25.250 --> 40:27.000
while Mao represents
the eastern spring wood,

40:27.000 --> 40:29.930
corresponding
to Mulan Hunting Ground's location.

40:34.710 --> 40:37.490
Even the shelves' arrangement
seems to mock the fact

40:37.490 --> 40:38.440
that Zhou Yan died

40:38.440 --> 40:40.900
in February,
when all things spring to life.

40:41.790 --> 40:44.730
[Imperial Secrets]

40:42.670 --> 40:43.360
That must be

40:43.360 --> 40:45.230
the imperial secret
on the Mao shelf in Section Jia.
